      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a great start. Some of my advisors are worried that focusing too much on these critiques might make the paper look biased. Could you provide a brief overview of the traditional counter-arguments used to defend these tests as valid meritocratic tools, just so I can prepare my rebuttals? I need to know what I'm up against.",
